  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU Justice and Legal Empowerment Programme - Phase II (EU JULE &#xbf; Phase II)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Action aimsis to strengthen the Rule of law and promote human rights through an increasingly qualified, transparent, more inclusive, and independent justice system in line with international human rights standards. The Action is expected to have a long-term impact on developing a more egalitarian society in Vietnam, where people have access to justice and the rule of law through efficient, coordinated, and result-oriented justice and legal services.&amp;nbsp;</narrative>
  </description>
